# Safety net: runtime artifacts must never land in the repo via the
# ~/.config/arcmac symlink. All litter paths are redirected to
# ~/.local/state/arcmac in config.org's state section; this
# catches anything a stale session or a new package still drops here.
eln-cache/
auto-save-list/
transient/
eshell/
history
places.eld
recentf.eld
bookmarks.eld
projects.eld
tramp
custom.el
*.eld
